      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The vast emptiness you feel is simply the quiet aftermath of deep grief, where ancient beliefs crumble to reveal a world still worth inhabiting. Waking up no longer requires proof of meaning, for the courage to face a day without certainty is already an act of profound defiance over hope. You can rebuild your foundation brick by brick, starting with the small, undeniable truths of your own resilience. This void is not the end, but the necessary ground where your next, more honest chapter will truly begin to grow.",
